[79.934408, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mwe need a contact form, what ways can it be created and what can you recommend?\u001b[39m                         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mCalled typo3-dev-companion, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe\u001b[7Gbest\u001b[12Gfit\u001b[16Gis\u001b[19Gthe\u001b[23Gcore\u001b[28Gform\u001b[33Gextension,\u001b[44GEXT:form.\u001b[54GIt's\u001b[59Galready\u001b[67Ginstalled\u001b[77G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3/cms-form ^14.3\u001b[99G\u001b[39mis\u001b[102Gin\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcomposer.json\u001b[39m) but not switched on for your site yet. Your m\u001b[64Gil\u001b[67Gsetup s\u001b[75Gnds to Mailpit in DDEV,\u001b[99Gso\u001b[102Gyou\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcan test the emails locally straight away.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe options\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mOption:\u001b[11G1. EXT:form (core)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWhat it is:\u001b[22m Editors build forms\u001b[35Gin\u001b[38Gthe\u001b[42G\"Forms\"\u001b[50Gbackend\u001b[58Gmodule\u001b[65Gor\u001b[68Gyou\u001b[72Gwrite\u001b[78Gthem\u001b[83Gin\u001b[86GYAML.\u001b[92GThey\u001b[97Ggo\u001b[100Gon\u001b[103Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  page with\u001b[15Gthe \"Form\" content element.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mGood:\u001b[22m Comes\u001b[15Gwith TYPO3\u001b[26Gand is maintained\u001b[44Gwith\u001b[49Git.\u001b[53GIt\u001b[56Ghandles\u001b[64Gserver-side\u001b[76Gvalidation,\u001b[88GCSRF\u001b[93Gprotection\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  and\u001b[9Ga honeypot\u001b[20Gspam trap. After submission it can em\u001b[58Gil the sit\u001b[69G owner, email the sender, save t\u001b[102G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthe\u001b[9Gdatabase, redirect or\u001b[31Gshow a thank-y\u001b[46Gu\u001b[48Gmess\u001b[53Gge. You\u001b[61Gcan\u001b[66Ghip\u001b[70Gthe form inside your sitep\u001b[97Gckage.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mBad:\u001b[22m Ch\u001b[11Gnging the ma\u001b[24Gkup\u001b[28Gmeans overriding Fluid templates\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65Gpartials. Subm\u001b[80Gs\u001b[83Gons are\u001b[91Gno\u001b[94G stored or\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  listed in the backend unles\u001b[34Gyou ad\u001b[41G someth\u001b[49Gng.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mOption:\u001b[22m \u001b[1m2. powermail (third-party)\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat it is:\u001b[22m A popular form extension\u001b[40Gthat\u001b[45Gstores\u001b[52Gsubmissions\u001b[64Gas\u001b[67Grecords\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mGood:\u001b[22m Backend\u001b[17Glist \u001b[23Gnd export of submissions, \u001b[50Gxtra spam check\u001b[66G, more features\u001b[82Gfor\u001b[86Geditors\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mBad:\u001b[22m Anoth\u001b[14Gr depende\u001b[24Gcy to keep up to date, and you\u001b[55Gneed\u001b[60Gto \u001b[64Gheck it supports TYPO3 14.3 before\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  choosing it. Too mu\u001b[25Gh\u001b[27Gf\u001b[29Gr a sim\u001b[37Gle con\u001b[44Gact form.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B─────────────────────────────────────\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
