mand \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mke_search\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mDefine the form in the sitepackage:\u001b[22m put it\u001b[49Gin\u001b[52Ga\u001b[54Gfile\u001b[59Glike\u001b[64G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Forms/contact.form.yaml\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[6Gwith name, email, subject, message and a pr\u001b[50Gvacy ch\u001b[58Gckbox. Register that folder as a form storage\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Blocation in a small form setup YAML. The\u001b[47Gform is\u001b[55Gt\u001b[58Gn under ver\u001b[70Gion\u001b[74Gcon\u001b[78Grol and\u001b[86Gworks \u001b[93Gn a fresh\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Binstall,\u001b[15Glike\u001b[20Gyour earlier stages.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B- One catch: b\u001b[21G default, forms stored\u001b[44Gin\u001b[47Gan\u001b[50Gextension\u001b[60Gare\u001b[64Gread-only\u001b[74Gin\u001b[77Gthe\u001b[81Gbackend\u001b[89Gform\u001b[94Geditor.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B \u001b[8GThat's fine for a demo\u001b[31Gdistribution. If editors should be \u001b[67Gble to\u001b[74Gchang\u001b[81Gthe form, you can allow\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Bsaving\u001b[15Gto the extensi\u001b[30Gn pa\u001b[35Gh or keep\u001b[45Gthe form in fileadmin.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mWhat happens after sending:\u001b[22m one email to the site owner, an optional\u001b[75Gcopy\u001b[80Gto\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87Gsender,\u001b[95Gthen\u001b[100Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gthank-you message or a redirect\u001b[38Gto a thank-you page. Put\u001b[63Gthe recipient address in a site\u001b[95Gsetting\u001b[103Gso\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bit isn't hard-coded.\u001b[27G \u001b[29G        \u001b[38G  \u001b[69G\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
