[632.271289, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5Gdesign's styl\u001b[19Gs.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSpam:\u001b[22m a submis\u001b[20Gion\u001b[24Gthat\u001b[29Gfills\u001b[35Gthe\u001b[39Ghidden\u001b[46Ghoneypot\u001b[55Gfield\u001b[61Gis\u001b[64Grejected\u001b[73Gand\u001b[77Gno\u001b[80Gmail\u001b[85Gis\u001b[88Gsent.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mValid message:\u001b[22m the\u001b[24Gvisitor sees the gr\u001b[44Gen \"Asante! Your\u001b[61Gmessag\u001b[68G has\u001b[73Gbeen sent.\"\u001b[85Gbox. In Mailpit,\u001b[102Gone\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gmail went to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249minfo@mtosafi.example\u001b[39m with the visi\u001b[53Gor\u001b[56Gas \u001b[60Geply-to,\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Ga copy went\u001b[85Gt\u001b[87G the vis\u001b[96Gtor. B\u001b[103Gth\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Buse a Mto\u001b[15GSafi mail layout instead of the TYPO3-b\u001b[55Ganded system m\u001b[70Gil.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mHow it's built:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mForm defini\u001b[17Gion:\u001b[22G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Forms/contact.form.yaml\u001b[39m,\u001b[65Gwith\u001b[70Gthe\u001b[74Gfields\u001b[81Gfrom\u001b[86G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdesign/contact.html\u001b[39m:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gname, email, phone, topic, message (at least 20 characters)\u001b[65Gand a consent checkbox. It's a file under\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bversion control, so\u001b[26Ghe back\u001b[34Gnd Forms module\u001b[50Gshows it but can't\u001b[69Gedit it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mStyling:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mConfiguration/Form/Sitepackage/config.yaml\u001b[39m replaces EXT:form's Bootstrap\u001b[87Gclasses\u001b[95Gwith\u001b[100Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdesign's\u001b[14Gclasses. The only template override is \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mForm.fluid.html\u001b[39m, which adds \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclass=\"form\"\u001b[39m to \u001b[99Ge form\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btag because a form d\u001b[26Gfi\u001b[29Gition can't\u001b[41Gset it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMails:\u001b[22m \u001b[13G \u001b[15Gite\u001b[19Glayout and \u001b[31Gemplates under \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Extensions/Form/\u001b[39m.\u001b[82GThe\u001b[86Gconsent\u001b[94Gcheckbox\u001b[103Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gleft out\u001b[14Gof the mails.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWiring:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3/form\u001b[39m i\u001b[26G now\u001b[31Ga\u001b[33Gdependency\u001b[44Gof\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Gsite\u001b[56Gset,\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3/cms-form\u001b[80G\u001b[39mis\u001b[83Gin\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gsitepackage's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcomposer.js\u001b[17Gn\u001b[39m. The\u001b[24G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcomposer.lock\u001b[39m update also adds \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtpwd/ke_search\u001b[39m, which the \u001b[82Gitepackage already\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Brequired but the lock had missed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mContact page:\u001b[22m a new script, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mBuild/Initialisation/seed-contact-form.php\u001b[39m,\u001b[77Gruns\u001b[82Gafter\u001b[88G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mseed-pages.php\u001b[39m.\u001b[104GIt\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gswitches the p\u001b[20Gge to the \"Sidebar right\" layout, puts the form in the main area and moves the address,\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bopening hours \u001b[20Gnd\u001b[23G\"Report a problem\" into the sidebar. I re-exported \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[39m, and the diff contain\u001b[105G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bnly those changes. The README explains all of this.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mStill open:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mFresh-i\u001b[13Gstall check:\u001b[26G\u001b[22mthis\u001b[31Gneeds\u001b[37Gan\u001b[40Gempty\u001b[46Gdatabase,\u001b[56Gand\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gsafety\u001