[633.013836, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5Guse a\u001b[11GMto Safi mail l\u001b[27Gyout ins\u001b[36Gead of the TYPO3-brande\u001b[61Gsyst\u001b[66Gm mail.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mHow it's built:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mForm definition:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Forms/contact.form.yaml\u001b[39m, with the\u001b[74Gfields\u001b[81Gfrom\u001b[86G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdesign/contact.html\u001b[39m:\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bname,\u001b[11Gemail,\u001b[18Gphone,\u001b[25Gtopic,\u001b[32Gmessage\u001b[40G(at\u001b[44Gleast\u001b[50G20\u001b[53Gcharacters)\u001b[65Gand\u001b[69Ga\u001b[71Gconsent\u001b[79Gcheckbox.\u001b[89GIt's\u001b[94Ga\u001b[96Gfile\u001b[101Gunder\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  version control,\u001b[22Gso\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Gbackend\u001b[37GForms\u001b[43Gmodule\u001b[50Gshows\u001b[56Git\u001b[59Gbut\u001b[63Gcan't\u001b[69Gedit\u001b[74Git.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mStyling:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mConfigurati\u001b[26Gn/Form/S\u001b[35Gtepackage/config.yaml\u001b[39m replaces EXT:form's Bootstrap classes with the\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdesign's c\u001b[16Gasses. The only\u001b[32Gt\u001b[34Gmplate override\u001b[50Gis\u001b[53G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mForm.fluid.html\u001b[39m, which adds \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclass=\"form\"\u001b[94G\u001b[39mto th\u001b[101Gform\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btag because a form definition can't \u001b[42Get it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMai\u001b[9Gs:\u001b[22m a\u001b[14Gsite layout and templates under \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Extensions/Form/\u001b[39m. The consent checkbox is\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bl\u001b[7Gft out\u001b[14Gof th\u001b[20G mails.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWiring:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3/form\u001b[24G\u001b[39mis now a depe\u001b[38Gdency of the\u001b[51Gsite\u001b[56Gset,\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3/cms-form\u001b[80G\u001b[39mis\u001b[83Gin\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gsitepackage's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcomposer.json\u001b[39m. The \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcomposer.lock\u001b[39m updat\u001b[44G also adds \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtpwd/ke_search\u001b[39m, which the sit\u001b[85Gpackage alr\u001b[97Gady\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Br\u001b[7Gquired\u001b[14Gbut the lock had\u001b[31Gmissed.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mContact page:\u001b[22m a new \u001b[26Gcript,\u001b[33G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mBuild/Initialisation/seed-contac\u001b[66G-f\u001b[69Grm.php\u001b[39m, runs after \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mseed-pages.php\u001b[39m.\u001b[104GIt\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bswitches the page to the \"Sidebar right\" \u001b[47Gayout, puts the form in\u001b[71Gt\u001b[73Ge main area and moves the address,\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bopen\u001b[10Gng ho\u001b[16Grs and \"Report\u001b[31Ga problem\"\u001b[42Ginto\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Gsidebar.\u001b[60GI\u001b[62Gre-exported\u001b[74G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[39m,\u001b[84Gand\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Gdiff\u001b[97Gcontains\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gonly those changes.\u001b[25GThe README explains all of this.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mStill open:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mFresh-install check:\u001b[22m this needs an empty database, and\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gsafety\u001b[71Gcheck\u001b[77Gblocked\u001b[85Gme\u001b[88Gfrom\u001b[93Gdropping\u001b[102Git.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BYour\u001b[10Ginstallation\u001b[23Gis\u001b[26Gunchanged\u001b[36Gby\u001b[39Gthat\u001b[44Gattempt.\u001b[53GTo\u001b[56Grun\u001b[60Git\u001b[63Gyourself,\u001b[73Geither\u001b[80Gfollow\u001b[87G\"Starting\u001b[97Gover\"\u001b[103Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \"Fresh install\"\u001b[21Gin\u001b[24Gthe\u001b[28Groot\u001b[33G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mREADME.md\u001b[39m,\u001b[44Gor\u001b[47Gtell\u001b[52Gme\u001b[55Gto\u001b[58Ggo\u001b[61Gahead\u001b[67Gand\u001b[71GI'l