,\u001b[77Gruns after \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mseed-pages.php\u001b[39m.\u001b[104GIt\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bswitch\u001b[12Gs\u001b[14Gthe\u001b[18Gpage to t\u001b[28Ge \"S\u001b[33Gdebar\u001b[39Gright\"\u001b[46Glayout,\u001b[54Gputs\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gform\u001b[68Gin\u001b[71Gthe\u001b[75Gmain\u001b[80Garea\u001b[85Gand\u001b[89Gmoves\u001b[95Gthe\u001b[99Gaddress,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gopening hours\u001b[20Gnd \"Report a\u001b[33Gproblem\" into the sidebar. I re-exported \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[39m, and\u001b[88Gthe diff contains\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bonly those chan\u001b[22Gs. The README explains a\u001b[47Gl \u001b[50Gf this.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mStill open:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mFresh-install check:\u001b[26G\u001b[22mthis\u001b[31Gneeds\u001b[37Gan\u001b[40Gempty\u001b[46Gdatabase,\u001b[56Gand\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gsafety\u001b[71Gcheck\u001b[77Gblocked\u001b[85Gme\u001b[88Gfrom\u001b[93Gdropping\u001b[102Git.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  Your installation\u001b[23Gis\u001b[26Gunchanged\u001b[36Gby\u001b[39Gthat\u001b[44Gattempt.\u001b[53GTo\u001b[56Grun\u001b[60Git\u001b[63Gyourself,\u001b[73Geither\u001b[80Gfollow\u001b[87G\"Starting\u001b[97Gover\"\u001b[103Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\"Fresh install\" in the root \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mREADME.md\u001b[39m, or tell m\u001b[54G to go ahead and\u001b[71GI'll do it betw\u001b[87Gen two database\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsnapshots and restore yours afterwards. A snapshot\u001b[56Gfrom bef\u001b[65Gre my changes exists as\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbefore-contact-form\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mVisual check:\u001b[19G\u001b[22mI only checked th\u001b[37G HTML, not the page in a br\u001b[65Gwser.\u001b[71GPleas\u001b[77G look at\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gtwo-column\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Blayout.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMail send\u001b[15Gr:\u001b[22m the mails com\u001b[32G from\u001b[38G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnoreply@mtosafi.example\u001b[39m. On a live server, th\u001b[86Gdomain has to allow\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthe server\u001b[16Gto\u001b[19Gsend\u001b[24Gmail\u001b[29Gfor\u001b[33Git.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
