[726.253051, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mLast check: does the installation\u001b[37Gregister\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gform\u001b[55Gsetup\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gdefinition?\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mCalled typo3-dev-companion \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe\u001b[7Gcontact\u001b[15Gform\u001b[20Gis\u001b[23Gon\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30GContact\u001b[38Gpage,\u001b[44Gbuilt\u001b[50Gwith\u001b[55GEXT:form,\u001b[65Gand\u001b[69Git\u001b[72Gworks\u001b[78Gin\u001b[81Gyour\u001b[86GDDEV\u001b[91Ginstallation.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNothing is committed. One check is still open: importing\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gnew\u001b[68G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[77G\u001b[39minto\u001b[82Ga\u001b[84Gfresh\u001b[90Ginstallation.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I tested on \u001b]8;id=12ra721;https://demo.ddev.site/contact\u0007\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mhttps://demo.ddev.site/contact\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[39m:\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BWrong input:\u001b[22m each bad field \u001b[34Ghows\u001b[39Gits own message\u001b[55Gunder\u001b[62Gt\u001b[64Gand th\u001b[71G field is marked\u001b[88Gr\u001b[90Gd with\u001b[97Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdesign's styles.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mSpam:\u001b[22m a submission that fills the\u001b[39Gh\u001b[41Gdden honeypot field is rejecte\u001b[74Gnd no\u001b[80Gmail\u001b[85Gis\u001b[88Gsent.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mValid message:\u001b[20G\u001b[22mthe visitor\u001b[32Gsees the green\u001b[47G\"Asante! Your\u001b[61Gme\u001b[64Gsage has been\u001b[78Gsent.\"\u001b[85Gbox.\u001b[90GIn\u001b[93GMailpit,\u001b[102Gone\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bmail\u001b[10Gwent\u001b[15Gto\u001b[18G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249minfo@mtosafi.example\u001b[39G\u001b[39mwith\u001b[44Gthe\u001b[48Gvisitor\u001b[56Gas\u001b[59Greply-to,\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Ga\u001b[75Gcopy\u001b[80Gwent\u001b[85Gto\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Gvisitor.\u001b[101GBoth\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  use a Mto Safi\u001b[20Gmail\u001b[25Glayout\u001b[32Ginstead\u001b[40Gof\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47GTYPO3-branded\u001b[61Gsystem\u001b[68Gmail.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mHow it's built:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mForm definition:\u001b[22G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Forms/contact.form.yaml\u001b[39m, wi\u001b[68Gh the\u001b[74Gfields\u001b[81Gfrom\u001b[86G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdesign/contact.html\u001b[39m:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gname, email, phone, topic, message (at least 20 characters) and a consent checkbox. It's a file under\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bv\u001b[7Grsion control, so the back\u001b[34Gnd Forms modul\u001b[50Gshows it but can't edit it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mStyling:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mConfiguration/Form/Sitepackage/config.yaml\u001b[57G\u001b[39mreplaces\u001b[66GEXT:form's\u001b[77GBootstrap\u001b[87Gclasses\u001b[95Gwith\u001b[100Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdesign's\u001b[14Gclasses. The only template ov\u001b[45Gride is \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mForm.fluid.html\u001b[39m, which adds \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclass=\"form\"\u001b[94G\u001b[39mto the form\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btag because\u001b[17Ga form definition\u001b[35Gcan't\u001b[41Gset\u001b[45Git.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMails:\u001b[22m a site layout a\u001b[28Gd templates under \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Extension\u001b[74G/F\u001b[79G/\u001b[39m. The\u001b[86Gconsen\u001b[93G checkbox is\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bleft out of the mails.          \u001b[38G  \u001b[69G\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
