[731.398992, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mLast check: does\u001b[20Gthe\u001b[24Ginstallation\u001b[37Gregister\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gform\u001b[55Gsetup\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gdefinition?\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mCalled typo3-dev-companion \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe\u001b[7Gcontact\u001b[15Gform\u001b[20Gis\u001b[23Gon\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30GContact\u001b[38Gpage,\u001b[44Gbuilt\u001b[50Gwith\u001b[55GEXT:form,\u001b[65Gand\u001b[69Git\u001b[72Gworks\u001b[78Gin\u001b[81Gyour\u001b[86GDDEV\u001b[91Ginstallation.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNothing is committed. One check\u001b[35Gis\u001b[38Gstill\u001b[44Gopen:\u001b[50Gimporting\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gnew\u001b[68G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[77G\u001b[39minto\u001b[82Ga\u001b[84Gfresh\u001b[90Ginstallation.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[1mWhat I tested on \u001b]8;id=12ra721;https://demo.ddev.site/contact\u0007\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mhttps://demo.ddev.site/contact\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[39m:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mWrong input:\u001b[22m each bad field shows its own message under it\u001b[64Gand\u001b[68Gthe field is m\u001b[83Grked red with the\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdesign's\u001b[14Gstyles.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mSpam:\u001b[22m a submission that fills the hidden honeypot\u001b[55Gfield\u001b[61Gis\u001b[64Grejected\u001b[73Gand\u001b[77Gno\u001b[80Gmail\u001b[85Gis\u001b[88Gsent.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mValid\u001b[11Gmessage:\u001b[22m t\u001b[22Ge visitor sees the gree\u001b[47G\"A\u001b[50Gant\u001b[54G! You\u001b[61Gmessage \u001b[70Gas b\u001b[75Gen\u001b[78Gsent.\" box. In Mailpit,\u001b[102Gone\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bmail went \u001b[16Go \u001b[38;2;177;185;249minfo@mtosafi.example\u001b[39G\u001b[39mwith\u001b[44Gthe\u001b[48Gvisitor\u001b[56Gas\u001b[59Greply-to,\u001b[69Gand\u001b[73Ga\u001b[75Gcopy\u001b[80Gwent\u001b[85Gto\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Gvisitor.\u001b[101GBoth\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Guse a\u001b[11GMto Safi mail l\u001b[27Gyout ins\u001b[36Gead of the TYPO3-brande\u001b[61Gsyst\u001b[66Gm mail.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mHow it's built:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mForm definition:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Forms/contact.form.yaml\u001b[39m, with the\u001b[74Gfields\u001b[81Gfrom\u001b[86G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdesign/contact.html\u001b[39m:\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bname,\u001b[11Gemail,\u001b[18Gphone,\u001b[25Gtopic,\u001b[32Gmessage\u001b[40G(at\u001b[44Gleast\u001b[50G20\u001b[53Gcharacters)\u001b[65Gand\u001b[69Ga\u001b[71Gconsent\u001b[79Gcheckbox.\u001b[89GIt's\u001b[94Ga\u001b[96Gfile\u001b[101Gunder\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  version control,\u001b[22Gso\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Gbackend\u001b[37GForms\u001b[43Gmodule\u001b[50Gshows\u001b[56Git\u001b[59Gbut\u001b[63Gcan't\u001b[69Gedit\u001b[74Git.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mStyling:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mConfigurati\u001b[26Gn/Form/S\u001b[35Gtepackage/config.yaml\u001b[39m replaces EXT:form's Bootstrap classes with the\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdesign's c\u001b[16Gasses. The only\u001b[32Gt\u001b[34Gmplate override\u001b[50Gis\u001b[53G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mForm.fluid.html\u001b[39m, which adds \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclass=\"form\"\u001b[94G\u001b[39mto th\u001b[101Gform\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btag because a form definition can't \u001b[42Get it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMai\u001b[9Gs:\u001b[22m a\u001b[14Gsite layout and templates under \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Extensions/Form/\u001b[39m. The consent checkbox is\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bl\u001b[7Gft out\u001b[14Gof th\u001b[20G mails.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWiring:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3/form\u001b[24G\u001b[39mis now a depe\u001b[38Gde\u001b[69G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m3/cms-form\u001b[80G\