[731.748777, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Guse a\u001b[11GMto Safi mail l\u001b[27Gyout ins\u001b[36Gead of the TYPO3-brande\u001b[61Gsyst\u001b[66Gm mail.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mHow it's built:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mForm definition:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Forms/contact.form.yaml\u001b[39m, with the\u001b[74Gfields\u001b[81Gfrom\u001b[86G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdesign/contact.html\u001b[39m:\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bname,\u001b[11Gemail,\u001b[18Gphone,\u001b[25Gtopic,\u001b[32Gmessage\u001b[40G(at\u001b[44Gleast\u001b[50G20\u001b[53Gcharacters)\u001b[65Gand\u001b[69Ga\u001b[71Gconsent\u001b[79Gcheckbox.\u001b[89GIt's\u001b[94Ga\u001b[96Gfile\u001b[101Gunder\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  version control,\u001b[22Gso\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Gbackend\u001b[37GForms\u001b[43Gmodule\u001b[50Gshows\u001b[56Git\u001b[59Gbut\u001b[63Gcan't\u001b[69Gedit\u001b[74Git.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mStyling:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mConfigurati\u001b[26Gn/Form/S\u001b[35Gtepackage/config.yaml\u001b[39m replaces EXT:form's Bootstrap classes with the\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdesign's c\u001b[16Gasses. The only\u001b[32Gt\u001b[34Gmplate override\u001b[50Gis\u001b[53G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mForm.fluid.html\u001b[39m, which adds \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mclass=\"form\"\u001b[94G\u001b[39mto th\u001b[101Gform\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btag because a form definition can't \u001b[42Get it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMai\u001b[9Gs:\u001b[22m a\u001b[14Gsite layout and templates under \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Extensions/Form/\u001b[39m. The consent checkbox is\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bl\u001b[7Gft out\u001b[14Gof th\u001b[20G mails.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWiring:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3/form\u001b[24G\u001b[39mis now a depe\u001b[38Gdency of the\u001b[51Gsite\u001b[56Gset,\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65G\u001b[38;2;177;1