port a problem\" into the sidebar. I re-exported \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[39m, and the diff contain\u001b[105G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bnly those changes. The README explains all of this.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mStill open:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mFresh-i\u001b[13Gstall check:\u001b[26G\u001b[22mthis\u001b[31Gneeds\u001b[37Gan\u001b[40Gempty\u001b[46Gdatabase,\u001b[56Gand\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gsafety\u001b[71Gcheck\u001b[77Gblocked\u001b[85Gme\u001b[88Gfrom\u001b[93Gdropping\u001b[102Git.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GYour installation is\u001b[26Guncha\u001b[32Gg\u001b[35G by that attempt. To\u001b[56Grun\u001b[60Git yourself, \u001b[74Gither follow \"Starting over\" and\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\"Fresh install\" in the root \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mREADME.md\u001b[39m,\u001b[44Gor tell me to go ahead and I'll do it bet\u001b[86Geen two database\u001b[103G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsnap\u001b[11Gots and restore yours\u001b[33Gafterwards. A\u001b[47Gsnapshot from\u001b[61Gbefore my\u001b[71Gchanges\u001b[79Gexists as\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbefore-contact-form\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mVisual check:\u001b[22m I only\u001b[26Gchecked\u001b[34Gthe\u001b[38GHTML,\u001b[44Gnot\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52Gpage\u001b[57Gin\u001b[60Ga\u001b[62Gbrowser.\u001b[71GPlease\u001b[78Glook\u001b[83Gat\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gtwo-column\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Glayout.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMail sender:\u001b[18G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[22Gmails\u001b[28Gcome\u001b[33Gfrom\u001b[38G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnoreply@mtosafi.example\u001b[39m.\u001b[63GOn\u001b[66Ga\u001b[68Glive\u001b[73Gserver,\u001b[81Gthat\u001b[86Gdomain\u001b[93Ghas\u001b[97Gto\u001b[100Gallow\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthe server to s\u001b[21Gnd mail for\u001b[33Git.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mHeading style:\u001b[22m the\u001b[24G\"Write to us\"\u001b[38Gsubheader\u001b[48Gshows\u001b[54Gas\u001b[57Gan\u001b[60G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m<h3>\u001b[39m,\u001b[66Gwhile\u001b[72Gthe\u001b[76Gdesign\u001b[83Ghas\u001b[87Ga\u001b[89Glead\u001b[94Gparagraph\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthere.        \u001b[20G   \u001b[24G      \u001b[31G  \u001b[34G   \u001b[38G  \u001b[69G\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[732.122018, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gtag because a form definition can't set it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mMails:\u001b[22m a\u001b[14Gsite layout and templates und\u001b[45G \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mResources/Private/Extensions/Form/\u001b[39m. The consent\u001b[94Gcheckbox is\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bleft out of\u001b[17Gthe mails.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWiring:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3/form\u001b[39m is \u001b[28Gow a dependency of the site set, and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3/cm\u001b[74G-f\u001b[79G\u001b[39m is in\u001b[86Gthe si\u001b[93Gepackage's\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcomposer.json\u001b[39m. The \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcomposer.lock\u001b[38G\u001b[39mupdate\u001b[45Galso\u001b[50Gadds\u001b[55G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtpwd/ke_search\u001b[39m,\u001b[71Gwhich\u001b[77Gthe\u001b[81Gsitepackage\u001b[93Galready\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Grequired but the lock\u001b[27Ghad\u001b[31Gmissed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mContact page:\u001b[22m a n\u001b[23Gw script, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mBuild/Initialisation/seed-contact-form.php\u001b[39m,\u001b[77Gruns after \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mseed-pages.php\u001b[39m.\u001b[104GIt\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bswitch\u001b[12Gs\u001b[14Gthe\u001b[18Gpage to t\u001b[28Ge \"S\u001b[33Gdebar\u001b[39Gright\"\u001b[46Glayout,\u001b[54Gputs\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gform\u001b[68Gin\u001b[71Gthe\u001b[75Gmain\u001b[80Garea\u001b[85Gand\u001b[89Gmoves\u001b[95Gthe\u001b[99Gaddress,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gopening hours\u001b[20Gnd \"Report a\u001b[33Gproblem\" into the sidebar. I re-exported \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[39m, and\u001b[88Gthe diff contains\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bonly those chan\u001b[22Gs. The README explains a\u001b[47Gl \u001b[50Gf this.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mStill open:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mFresh-install check:\u001b[26G\u001b[22mthis\u001b[31Gneeds\u001b[37Gan\u001b[40Gempty\u001b[46Gdatabase,\u001b[56Gand\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gsafety\u001b[71Gcheck\u001b[77Gblocked\u001b[85Gme\u001b[88Gfrom\u001b[93Gdropping\u001b[102Git.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  Your installation\u001b[23Gis\u001b[26Gunchanged\u001b[36Gby\u001b[39Gthat\u001b[44Gattempt.\u001b[53GTo\u001b[56Grun\u001b[60Git\u001b[63Gyourself,\u001b[73Geither\u001b[80Gfollow\u001b[87G\"Starting\u001b[97Gover\"\u001b[103Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\"Fresh install\" in the root \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mREADME.md\u001b[39m, or tell m\u001b[54G to go ahead and\u001b[71GI'll do it betw\u001b[87Gen two database\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsnapshots and restore yours afterwards. A snapshot\u001b[56Gfrom bef\u001b[65Gre my changes exists as\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbefore-contact-form\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mVisual check:\u001b[19G\u001b[22mI only checked th\u001b[37G HTML, not the page in a br\u001b[65Gwser.\u001b[71GPleas\u001b[77G look at\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gtwo-column\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Blayout.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMail send\u001b[15Gr:\u001b[22m the mails com\u001b[32G from\u001b[38G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnoreply@mtosafi.example\u001b[39m. On a live server, th\u001b[86Gdomain has to allow\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthe server\u001b[16Gto\u001b[19Gsend\u001b[24Gmail\u001b[29Gfor\u001b[33Git.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mHeading style:\u001b[22m the \"Write to us\"\u001b[38Gsubheader shows as an \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m<h3>\u001b[39m,\u001b[66Gwhile th\u001b[75G d\u001b[78Gsign has a lead paragr\u001b[101Gph\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Bre.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIf you want\u001b[15Gto\u001b[18Gcommit,\u001b[26Gsay\u001b[30Gso\u001b[33Gand\u001b[37GI'l\u001b[70Gfirst.\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
