data.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWhat the\u001b[12Gmunicipality\u001b[25Ghas\u001b[29Gto\u001b[32Gdecide\u001b[39Gor\u001b[42Gwrite;\u001b[49GI\u001b[51Ghaven't\u001b[59Gdecided\u001b[67Gany\u001b[71Gof\u001b[74Git\u001b[77Gfor\u001b[81Gthem:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mThe copy to the visitor\u001b[30G\u001b[22malso\u001b[35Gsends\u001b[41Gpersonal\u001b[50Gdata\u001b[55Gto\u001b[58Gwhatever\u001b[67Gaddress\u001b[75Gwas\u001b[79Gtyped.\u001b[86GOne\u001b[90Gtypo\u001b[95Gand\u001b[99Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   stranger gets the mes\u001b[28Gage.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2\u001b[6G\u001b[1mLegal basis:\u001b[22m answering a citiz\u001b[38G'\u001b[41Gm\u001b[43Gs\u001b[45Gage is probably part of th\u001b[72G municipality's public\u001b[95Gtask,\u001b[101Gnot\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bomething that n\u001b[23Geds consent.\u001b[36GIf\u001b[39Gso,\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47G\"I\u001b[50Gagree…\"\u001b[58Gcheckbox\u001b[67Gmay\u001b[71Gbe\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Gwrong\u001b[84Gtool\u001b[89Gand\u001b[93Gcould\u001b[99Gbecome\u001b[106Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gshort notice\u001b[19Gi\u001b[22Gt\u001b[24Gad. Whi\u001b[32Gh law applie\u001b[45G d\u001b[48Gpends \u001b[55Gn the\u001b[61Gdeployment,\u001b[73Gfor example Kenya's Da\u001b[97G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BProtection Ac\u001b[21G2019 or th\u001b[32G GDPR,\u001b[39Gand\u001b[47Gmunicipality's data\u001b[67Gprotection\u001b[78Gofficer shoul\u001b[95Gnfirm it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mThe privacy policy\u001b[22m is\u001b[28Gst\u001b[31Gll\u001b[34Gplaceho\u001b[42Gd\u001b[44Gr\u001b[46Gt\u001b[48Gxt, and the ch\u001b[63Gckbox links to it. B\u001b[84Gfore going live\u001b[100Git\u001b[103Ghas\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bto say what the form coll\u001b[32Gcts, why, who reads \u001b[53Gt and how long it's kept.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4\u001b[6G\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
