[872.676667, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5Gmodified submission is rejected.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mInjected markup:\u001b[22m th\u001b[25G mail te\u001b[34Gplates\u001b[41Gescape\u001b[48Geverything\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gvisitor\u001b[71Genters.\u001b[79GAll\u001b[83Gaddresses\u001b[93Gpass\u001b[98Gan\u001b[101Gemail\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcheck before they reach the mailer.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mLength limits:\u001b[22m \u001b[21Game i\u001b[27G capped\u001b[35Gat\u001b[38G200\u001b[42Gcharacters\u001b[53Gand\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Gmessage\u001b[69Gat\u001b[72G5,000.\u001b[79GThere's\u001b[87Gno\u001b[90Gfile\u001b[95Gupload,\u001b[103Gso\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gnothing lands on the server.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSpam bots:\u001b[22m the honeypot catches simple ones.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCookies:\u001b[22m loading the page\u001b[31Gsets\u001b[36Gnone,\u001b[42Gso\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Gform\u001b[54Gneeds\u001b[60Gno\u001b[63Gcookie\u001b[70Gbanner.\u001b[78GIn\u001b[81GTYPO3\u001b[87G14.3\u001b[92Gthe\u001b[96Ghoneypot\u001b[105Gno\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Blonger\u001b[12Guses\u001b[17Ga\u001b[19Gsession.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mData privacy\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWhat's good: \u001b[17Ghe form collec\u001b[32Gs only what's ne\u001b[49Gded,\u001b[54Gand the\u001b[62Gphone\u001b[68Gnumber is optio\u001b[84Gal. Nothing is st\u001b[102Gred\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bin TYPO3's d\u001b[16Gtabase.\u001b[24GThe\u001b[28Ghint\u001b[33Gtext\u001b[38Gasks\u001b[43Gpeople\u001b[50Gnot\u001b[54Gto\u001b[57Gsend\u001b[62GID\u001b[65Gor\u001b[68Gbank\u001b[73Gnumbers,\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gform\u001b[95Glogs\u001b[100Gno\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpersonal\u001b[12Gdata.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWhat the municipality has to decide or w\u001b[44Gite; I haven't decid\u001b[65Gd\u001b[68Gny of it for them:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mThe copy to the visitor\u001b[22m also\u001b[35Gsends\u001b[41Gpersonal\u001b[50Gdata\u001b[55Gto\u001b[58Gwhatever\u001b[67Gaddress\u001b[75Gwas\u001b[79Gtyped.\u001b[86GOne\u001b[90Gtypo\u001b[95Gand\u001b[99Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gstranger gets the message.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mLegal basis:\u001b[22m answ\u001b[24Gring a ci\u001b[34Gizen'\u001b[40G message is probably part of the municipality's publi\u001b[94G task, n\u001b[103Gt\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bome\u001b[11Ghing that ne\u001b[24Gds consent. If so, the \"I agree…\" checkbox \u001b[68Gay be the wrong tool \u001b[90Gnd\u001b[93Gcould\u001b[99Gbecome\u001b[106Ga\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bsh\u001b[9Grt notice instead. Which law applies depends on \u001b[58Ghe deploymen\u001b[71G, for exampl\u001b[84G Kenya's\u001b[93GData\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6GProtection Act 2019 or \u001b[30Ghe GDPR, and the municipality's data protection\u001b[78Goffic\u001b[84Gr should confirm it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mThe privacy policy\u001b[22m is still placeholder\u001b[46Gt\u001b[48Gxt,\u001b[52Gand the checkbox links to it.\u001b[82GBefore\u001b[89Ggoing\u001b[95Glive\u001b[100Git\u001b[103Ghas\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gto say what the form collects, why, who reads it and how long \u001b[69Gt's kept.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mRetention:\u001b[22m the only copy \u001b[32Gf each\u001b[39Gmessage\u001b[47Glives\u001b[53Gin\u001b[56Gthe\u001b[60G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249minfo@\u001b[66G\u001b[39mmailbox,\u001b[75Gso\u001b[78Ghow\u001b[82Glong\u001b[87Git's\u001b[92Gkept\u001b[97Gis\u001b[100Gset\u001b[104Gby\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gthe\u001b[10Gmunicipality's\u001b[25Gmail\u001b[30Gpolicy.\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
