[874.237997, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 5s · done 6:44 PM\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mwhat about data privacy and security?\u001b[39m                                                                   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe form is technically sound, but my design has one r\u001b[58Gal security\u001b[70Gflaw,\u001b[76Gand\u001b[80Ga\u001b[82Gfew\u001b[86Gprivacy\u001b[94Gdecisions\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbelong\u001b[10Gto\u001b[13Gthe\u001b[17Gsite\u001b[22Gowner.\u001b[29GMy\u001b[32Grecommendation\u001b[47Gis\u001b[50Gat\u001b[53Gthe\u001b[57Gend.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSecurity\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe flaw: the copy to the visitor can be abused to send spam.\u001b[22m Th\u001b[68G copy goes to whatever\u001b[91Gaddress\u001b[99Gsomeone\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btypes into the form. It includes the \u001b[41Game and mess\u001b[54Gge they ent\u001b[66Gred, and it c\u001b[80Gmes from\u001b[89G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mnoreply@mtosafi.example\u001b[39m. A spamme\u001b[37G can enter\u001b[48Ga stranger's\u001b[61Gaddress and the\u001b[77Gr own text, and the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmunicipality \u001b[17Gends it for them,\u001b[35Gfro\u001b[40Gits own domain. That hurts\u001b[67Gthe mun\u001b[75Gcipality's\u001b[86Gmail reputation, \u001b[104Go\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bits\u001b[7Greal mails start landing in\u001b[35Gspam\u001b[40Gfolders.\u001b[49GThe\u001b[53Ghoneypot\u001b[62Gonly\u001b[67Gstops\u001b[73Gsimple\u001b[80Gbots,\u001b[86Gand\u001b[90Gnothing\u001b[98Glimits\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhow\u001b[7Goften\u001b[13Gthe\u001b[17Gform\u001b[22