commands \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m The proof-of-work check is designed as PBKDF2-SHA256 over the\u001b[65Gnonce\u001b[71Gplus\u001b[76Ga\u001b[78Gcounter\u001b[86Guntil\u001b[92Gthe\u001b[96Gprefix\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmatches. I'm now running four cases: valid, missing, replayed, and forged.\u001b[78G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\u001b[K\r\u001b[40C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 4s)\u001b[39m\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
