ps bots that don't \u001b[58Gun JavaScript or d\u001b[78G't solve ALTCHA puzzles.\u001b[103GA\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Betermined\u001b[16Gspamm\u001b[22Gr can\u001b[29Gtill solve it cheaply: my script needed\u001b[69G0.1 sec\u001b[77Gnds. You can raise the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdifficulty in the site settings\u001b[37G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249maltcha.maximumComplexity\u001b[39m),\u001b[65Gbut that slow\u001b[79G dow\u001b[84G cheap phon\u001b[96Gs \u001b[99Goo.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCleanup needs a cron job.\u001b[22m Every page view s\u001b[49Gore\u001b[53G one puzzle in the database, and \u001b[87Gothing deletes them\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bautomatically. The scheduler extension isn't installed, so production needs a cron\u001b[88Gjob\u001b[92Grunning\u001b[100G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249maltcha:remove-obsolete-challenges --include-solved-challenges\u001b[39m. It'\u001b[72G in the README.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mReady for TYPO3 14.3 but not 15.\u001b[22m The ex\u001b[45Gension\u001b[52Gregisters i\u001b[64Gs form s\u001b[73Gtup the old TypoScript way, which\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BTYPO3 14.2 deprecated\u001b[27Gand\u001b[31G15\u001b[34Gremoves.\u001b[43GIt\u001b[46Gworks\u001b[52Gon\u001b[55G14.3,\u001b[61Gbut\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gextension\u001b[79Gmust\u001b[84Gbe\u001b[87Gupdated\u001b[95Gbefore\u001b[102Gany\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gmove to TYPO3 15.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mVisitors have to click the checkbox.\u001b[22m It verifies in under\u001b[63Ga second. Setting \u001b[38;2;177;185;249maltcha.auto: onfocus\u001b[102G\u001b[39mwould\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsolve\u001b[15Gpuzzle as\u001b[25Gsoon\u001b[30Gas\u001b[33Gsomeone\u001b[41Gstarts\u001b[48Gfilling\u001b[56Gin\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gform,\u001b[69Gso\u001b[72Git's\u001b[77Gusually\u001b[85Gdone\u001b[90Gbefore\u001b[97Gthey\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Greach the checkbox.     \u001b[30G   \u001b[34G      \u001b[69G\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
