[1230.510349, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThings you should know:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt's a hurdle, not a wall.\u001b[22m It stops bots that \u001b[52Gon't\u001b[57Grun JavaScript\u001b[72Gor\u001b[75Gdon't solve\u001b[87GALTCHA\u001b[94Gpuzzles.\u001b[103GA\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdetermined spammer can still\u001b[34Gsolve it\u001b[43Gcheaply: my script\u001b[62Gneeded\u001b[69G0.1\u001b[73Gseconds.\u001b[82GYou\u001b[86Gcan\u001b[90Graise\u001b[96Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdifficulty\u001b[16Gin\u001b[19Gthe\u001b[23Gsite\u001b[28Gsettings\u001b[37G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249maltcha.maximumComplexity\u001b[39m),\u001b[65Gbut\u001b[69Gthat\u001b[74Gslows\u001b[80Gdown\u001b[85Gcheap\u001b[91Gphones\u001b[98Gtoo.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mCleanup needs a\u001b[21Gcr\u001b[24Gn job.\u001b[31G\u001b[22mEvery\u001b[37Gpage\u001b[42Gview\u001b[47Gstores\u001b[54Gone\u001b[58Gpuzzle\u001b[65Gin\u001b[68Gthe\u001b[72Gdatabase,\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Gnothing\u001b[94Gdeletes\u001b[102Gthem\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gautomatically. The scheduler ex\u001b[37Gen\u001b[40Gion isn't installed,\u001b[61Gso produc\u001b[71Gi\u001b[73Gn\u001b[75Gneeds\u001b[81Ga cron job running \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3 \r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Baltcha:remove-obsolete-challenges --include-solved-challenges\u001b[39m. It's\u001b[73Gin the README.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mReady for TYPO3 14.3 but not 15.\u001b[22m The extension registers its form setup the \u001b[82Gld\u001b[85GTypoScript way, which\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GTYPO3 14.2 deprecated and\u001b[31G15 \u001b[35Gemoves. It works on 14.3, but\u001b[65Gthe extension must be updated before\u001b[102Gany\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bmove to TYPO3 15.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mVisitors have to click the checkbox.\u001b[22m It verifies in under a second.\u001b[73GSet\u001b[77Ging \u001b[38;2;177;185;249maltcha.auto: onfocus\u001b[102G\u001b[39mwould\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gsolve the puzzle as soon as someone starts fillin\u001b[55G in the form, so i\u001b[74G's\u001b[77Gusual\u001b[83Gy\u001b[85Gdone before they\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Breach\u001b[11Gthe ch\u001b[18Gckbox.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mContent Security Policy:\u001b[30G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[34Gextension\u001b[44Gloosens\u001b[52Gthe\u001b[56Gsite's\u001b[63GCSP\u001b[67Gfor\u001b[71Gthe\u001b[75Gwidget\u001b[82G(it\u001b[86Gallows\u001b[93G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mblob:\u001b[99G\u001b[39mworkers\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gand inline styles). That only has an\u001b[42Geffect if the frontend\u001b[65GCSP is swi\u001b[76Gched\u001b[81Gon.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BStill open from before:\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Gconsent\u001b[39Gtext\u001b[44Grenders\u001b[52Gbold\u001b[57Gwhile\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67Gdesign\u001b[74Gshows\u001b[80Gnormal\u001b[87Gweight\u001b[94G(a\u001b[97Gsmall\u001b[103GSass\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfix plus an asset build), and the fresh-install check of \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[39m. Tell\u001b[75Gme if you w\u001b[87Gnt either done, o\u001b[105G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsay \"comm\u001b[13Gt\"\u001b[16Gand I'll\u001b[25Gs\u001b[27Gow\u001b[30Gyou t\u001b[36Ge commit message first.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 2m 16s · done 6:51 PM\u001b[39G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mwhy are the mails I receive TYPO3 themed now and with a TYPO3 imprint?\u001b[39m                                  \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m·\u001b[3GMoo\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mnwa\u001b[38;2;215;119;87mlking… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt\u001b[39m\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
