[1232.625512, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt's a hurdle, not a wall.\u001b[32G\u001b[22mIt\u001b[35Gstops\u001b[41Gbots\u001b[46Gthat\u001b[51Gdon't\u001b[57Grun\u001b[61GJavaScript\u001b[72Gor\u001b[75Gdon't\u001b[81Gsolve\u001b[87GALTCHA\u001b[94Gpuzzles.\u001b[103GA\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  determined spammer can\u001b[28Gstill\u001b[34Gsolve\u001b[40Git\u001b[43Gcheaply:\u001b[52Gmy\u001b[55Gscript\u001b[62Gneeded\u001b[69G0.1\u001b[73Gseconds.\u001b[82GYou\u001b[86Gcan\u001b[90Graise\u001b[96Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdifficulty in the site setting\u001b[36G (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249maltcha.maximumComplexity\u001b[39m), but that sl\u001b[77Gws down cheap phones too\u001b[103G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCleanup needs a cron job.\u001b[22m Every page view stores one puzzl\u001b[64G in the database,\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Gnothing deletes\u001b[102Gthem\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bautomatically. The scheduler extension isn't installed, so production needs a cron job ru\u001b[95Gning \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249maltcha:remove-obsolete-challenges --include-solved-challenges\u001b[39m.\u001b[68GIt's in the README.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mReady for TYPO3 14.3 but not 15.\u001b[22m The exte\u001b[47Gsion registers its form setup the\u001b[81Gold TypoScript way, which\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BTYPO3 14.2 deprecated and 15 removes. It works on 14.3, but the extension must be updated\u001b[95Gbefore\u001b[102Gany\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gmove to TYPO3 15.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mVisitors have to click the checkbox.\u001b[22m It verifies in under a\u001b[65Gsecond. Setting \u001b[38;2;177;185;249maltcha.auto: onfocus\u001b[102G\u001b[39mwould\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bs\u001b[7Glve the puzzle as\u001b[25Gsoon\u001b[30Gas\u001b[33Gsomeone\u001b[41Gstarts\u001b[48Gfilling\u001b[56Gin\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gform,\u001b[69Gso\u001b[72Git's\u001b[77Gusually\u001b[85Gdone\u001b[90Gbefore\u001b[97Gthey\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Greach the checkbox.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mContent Security Policy:\u001b[30G\u001b[22mthe exte\u001b[39Gsion loosens the\u001b[56Gsite's\u001b[63GCSP for the widget (it allows \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mblob:\u001b[39m workers\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Band inline styles)\u001b[25GThat\u001b[30Gonly\u001b[35Ghas\u001b[39Gan\u001b[42Geffect\u001b[49Gif\u001b[52Gthe\u001b[56Gfrontend\u001b[65GCSP\u001b[69Gis\u001b[72Gswitched\u001b[81Gon.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BStill\u001b[9Gopen from b\u001b[21Gfore: the consent\u001b[39Gtext r\u001b[46Gnders\u001b[52Gbold whil\u001b[62G the design shows n\u001b[82Grmal\u001b[87Gweight\u001b[94G(a\u001b[97Gsmall\u001b[103GSass\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfix\u001b[7Gplus\u001b[12Gan\u001b[15Gasset\u001b[21Gbuild),\u001b[29Gand\u001b[33Gthe\u001b[37Gfresh-install\u001b[51Gcheck\u001b[57Gof\u001b[60G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[39m.\u001b[70GTell\u001b[75Gme\u001b[78Gif\u001b[81Gyou\u001b[85Gwant\u001b[90Geither\u001b[97Gdone,\u001b[103Gor\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsay \"c\u001b[10Gmmit\" and I'll show you the commit message first.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 2m 16s · done 6:51 PM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mwhy are the mails I receive TYPO3 themed now and with a TYPO3 imprint?\u001b[39m                                  \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Running \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
