[1235.240211, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249maltcha:remove-obsolete-challenges --include-solved-challenges\u001b[39m. It's in the README.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mReady for TYPO3 14.3 but not 15.\u001b[22m The ext\u001b[46Gnsion\u001b[52Gregisters\u001b[62Gits form setup the old TypoScr\u001b[93Gpt\u001b[96Gway,\u001b[101Gwhich\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BTYPO3 14.2\u001b[16Gdeprecated and 15 removes. It works on 14.3, but\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gexten\u001b[75Gi\u001b[77Gn must be updated before any\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gmove to TYPO3 15.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mVisitors have to click the checkbox.\u001b[22m It verif\u001b[51Ge\u001b[53G in under a second. Setting\u001b[81G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249maltcha.auto: onfocus\u001b[39m would\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsolve the puzzle as soon as someone starts filling in the form, so it's usually done\u001b[90Gbefore\u001b[97Gthey\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Greach the checkbox.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mContent Security Policy:\u001b[22m the\u001b[34Gextension loosen\u001b[52Gthe site's CSP for \u001b[72Ghe widget (it allows \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mblob:\u001b[39m workers\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Band inline styles).\u001b[25GThat\u001b[30Gonly\u001b[35Ghas\u001b[39Gan\u001b[42Geffect\u001b[49Gif\u001b[52Gthe\u001b[56Gfrontend\u001b[65GCSP\u001b[69Gis\u001b[72Gswitched\u001b[81Gon.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BStil\u001b[8G open from b\u001b[21Gfore: the consent tex\u001b[43G \u001b[45Genders bold whil\u001b[63Gthe de\u001b[70Gign show\u001b[79G normal w\u001b[89Gight (a\u001b[97Gsmall\u001b[103GSass\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfix plus an\u001b[15Gasset build),\u001b[29Gand\u001b[33Gthe\u001b[37Gfresh-install\u001b[51Gcheck\u001b[57Gof\u001b[60G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[39m.\u001b[70GTell\u001b[75Gme\u001b[78Gif\u001b[81Gyou\u001b[85Gwant\u001b[90Geither\u001b[97Gdone,\u001b[103Gor\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsay \"commit\" and I