[1354.854685, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhy it happened:\u001b[22m ALTCHA \u001b[28Ghips\u001b[33Gi\u001b[35Gs\u001b[37Gown cop\u001b[45G of\u001b[49GTYPO3's mail template, wh\u001b[75Gch\u001b[78Guses the \u001b[88GYPO3 \"SystemEmail\"\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Blayout\u001b[10Gwith\u001b[15Gthe\u001b[19Glogo\u001b[24Gand\u001b[28Gcopyright\u001b[38Gnotice.\u001b[46GIt\u001b[49Gregisters\u001b[59Gthat\u001b[64Gcopy\u001b[69Gfor\u001b[73Gboth\u001b[78Gmail\u001b[83Gfinishers\u001b[93Gunder\u001b[99Gkey\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m2011\u001b[39m. When several template path\u001b[37Gare\u001b[41Gregistered, the\u001b[57Gone with the hig\u001b[74Gest\u001b[78Gkey wins, and my si\u001b[99G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btemplate had k\u001b[18Gy \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m20\u001b[39m.\u001b[24GSo after ALTCHA was ins\u001b[48Galled, it\u001b[60Gemplate replaced the site's. ALTCHA ships the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcopy so the solved\u001b[22Gpuzz\u001b[27Ge doesn't\u001b[38Gppear a\u001b[46G a form value in \u001b[65Ge mail.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe fix, in two files:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mForm setup:\u001b[17G\u001b[22min\u001b[20G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mConfiguration/Form/Sitepackage/config.yaml\u001b[39m,\u001b[64Gthe\u001b[68Gsite's\u001b[75Gmail\u001b[80Gtemplate\u001b[89Gand\u001b[93Glayout\u001b[100Gpaths\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  now use key \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m2100\u001b[39m for\u001b[26Gboth\u001b[31Gfinishers,\u001b[42Gso\u001b[45Gthey\u001b[50Gwin\u001b[54Gover\u001b[59GALTCHA's\u001b[68G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m2011\u001b[39m.\u001b[74GA\u001b[76Gcomment\u001b[84Gexplains\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gnumber.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMail\u001b[10Gt\u001b[12Gmplates:\u001b[22m the site's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDefault.fluid.html\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDefault.fluid.txt\u001b[39m leave out the ALTCHA field, \u001b[102Gs\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BALTCHA's own template does. Otherwise the long encoded puzzle solution\u001b[76Gw\u001b[78Guld appear \u001b[91G the mail.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThis will happen again whenever an ext\u001b[42Gnsion re\u001b[51Gisters mail templates with a higher key.\u001b[92GAfter\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Binstalling\u001b[14Gor\u001b[17Gupdating\u001b[26Ga\u001b[28Gform\u001b[33Gextension,\u001b[44Gcheck\u001b[50Gone\u001b[54Gmail\u001b[59Gin\u001b[62GMailpit.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNothing is\u001b[14Gcommitted yet. Still open: the consent text re\u001b[61Gders bold\u001b[71Ginstead\u001b[79Gof\u001b[82Gnormal\u001b[89Gweight,\u001b[97Gand\u001b[101Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfresh-install\u001b[17Gcheck\u001b[23Gof\u001b[26G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 1m 42s · done 6:53 PM\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mIf you can solve this puzzle so quickly cant an attacker do the same?\u001b[39m                                   \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Running \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\u001b[K\r\u001b[40C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mought for 5s)\u001b[39m\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
